-2. **Subtitle QC:** `✓ QC phụ đề` checks basic timing/text validity, overlaps, reading speed, line count and line length. These are review heuristics, not a full broadcast-standard subtitle validator.
-3. **Whisper AI:** click `Whisper AI`, choose an audio file, then choose Vietnamese, English or auto detection. The current guardrails are 100 MB per file and 8 minutes per audio. Audio is decoded/resampled in the browser and passed to a module worker for local CPU/WASM inference. Timestamped Whisper chunks become text clips on canonical subtitle track 3; the resulting cues should still be reviewed and checked with `QC phụ đề`.
